                        "entry_id": "d13fbac2-aa48-3fd3-9ebe-be81a8e52274",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pitch thrown with the ball gripped on the fingertips and released with no rotation, which travels over an unpredictable path to the plate due to micro-turbulence in the air."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13540cc7-d376-4b6d-b452-5eee53e54ce4",
                                "sense_id": "a74e15ed-21a6-39a3-a24d-bd205c1bc30f",
                                "text": "Even the pitcher doesn't know where his knuckleball is going."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4fbe5bb-769e-4b7a-a799-2d72e5056fa0",
                                "sense_id": "a74e15ed-21a6-39a3-a24d-bd205c1bc30f",
                                "text": "Boston Red Sox pitcher Tim Wakefield is best known for his use of the knuckleball."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2190a9a-7990-3a6e-ba2b-3cb76470e054",
                        "entry_id": "d13fbac2-aa48-3fd3-9ebe-be81a8e52274",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of delivery where a fast bowler holds the ball on the knuckles of the index and middle fingers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
